  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aeba2aa4-7f8b-4976-b94a-dbb10578566b.png\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">和平枯竭</p>\n<h2>特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">移除了原版和平模式下的自动生命值和饥饿值恢复机制，即使在和平、简单和普通难度下也会允许饥饿致死。此外，当安装<strong>&nbsp;<code><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Tough As Nails</span></code>&nbsp;</strong>模组时，和平模式下的水分恢复也将被禁用。</li>\n</ul>",
